  "details": "Version: VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2020.09.25.00.08_Public\nIf your model has an avatar descriptor on it and you switch from \"Generic\" to \"Humanoid\", the avatar descriptor overwrites the \"Action\" playable layer with a duplicate of the \"FX\" playable layer. This fixes itself if you reset the layers to default.\nSteps to reproduce:\nBring a model into Unity, ensure it's set as \"Generic\"\nAdd an avatar descriptor\nTurn on custom playable layers on the descriptor\nSwitch the model to \"Humanoid\"\nLook at the playable layers",
